    category: "漏洞與威脅情報",
    title: "Rockwell Automation OTTO Fleet Manager 存在弱密碼雜湊漏洞，CVSS 6.8，建議立即修補",
    summary: "Rockwell Automation 的 OTTO Fleet Manager 存在一個安全漏洞 (CVE-2026-75112)。此漏洞源於 bcrypt 密碼雜湊實作中工作因子（work factor）不足，使得攻擊者在取得未加密的系統備份後，能以較低的計算成本執行離線暴力破解攻擊，從而更容易竊取帳號密碼。該漏洞影響 OTTO Fleet Manager 版本 <=V2.36.2。此漏洞的 CVSS v3.1 分數為 6.8（中等風險）。Rockwell Automation 已在版本 2.36.3 中修復此問題。建議用戶應立即升級至修復版本，或參考廠商提供的安全最佳實務，例如透過防火牆隔離控制系統網路，並限制網路暴露，以降低被攻擊的風險。",
    tags: ["Rockwell Automation", "OTTO Fleet Manager", "CVE-2026-75112", "密碼雜湊", "OT/ICS", "CVSS"],
    title_en: "Rockwell Automation OTTO Fleet Manager has weak password hashing vulnerability, CVSS 6.8, immediate patching recommended",
    summary_en: "Rockwell Automation's OTTO Fleet Manager contains a security vulnerability (CVE-2026-75112). This vulnerability stems from an insufficient work factor in the bcrypt password hashing implementation, allowing an attacker who obtains an unencrypted system backup to perform offline brute-force attacks with lower computational cost, making it easier to steal account credentials. The vulnerability affects OTTO Fleet Manager versions <=V2.36.2. The CVSS v3.1 score for this vulnerability is 6.8 (Medium risk). Rockwell Automation has fixed this issue in version 2.36.3. Users are advised to immediately upgrade to the patched version, or follow vendor-provided security best practices, such as isolating the control system network with a firewall and limiting network exposure, to mitigate the risk of attack.",
    tags_en: ["Rockwell Automation", "OTTO Fleet Manager", "CVE-2026-75112", "Password Hashing", "OT/ICS", "CVSS"],
    sources: [
      { name: "CISA KEV Catalog", url: "https://cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-239-03", lang: "EN" }
    ]
