    title: "iOS 27升級Apple Pay體驗：新增美聯匯兌點數支付、「點擊分享」及帳戶管理功能",
    summary: "Apple宣布多項Apple Pay升級功能，旨在提升用戶的支付和購物體驗。在iOS 27中，Apple Pay的結帳介面經過重新設計，用戶可更方便地在不同卡片間滑動切換，並查看卡片獎勵、餘額等資訊。此外，Apple與American Express合作，用戶可直接使用美聯匯兌（American Express）點數在Apple Pay結帳流程中支付，點數價值為每點0.7美分。新功能「點擊分享」（Tap to Share）將整合至Apple Pay，提供更個人化、更快速的實體店購物體驗，允許用戶安全分享電子郵件、地址、會員點數等資訊。未來，用戶還將能在Apple Pay介面管理直扣卡（debit card）餘額，並為其充值。此外，Walmart和Sam’s Club也宣布將逐步擴大支援Apple Pay的範圍，預計今年底在美國所有門市推出。",
    tags: ["Apple Pay", "iOS 27", "American Express", "Apple Wallet", "Tap to Share", "Apple"],
    title_en: "iOS 27 upgrades Apple Pay experience with new American Express points payment, 'Tap to Share,' and account management features",
    summary_en: "Apple has announced multiple upgrades to Apple Pay features aimed at enhancing the user's payment and shopping experience. In iOS 27, the Apple Pay checkout interface has been redesigned, allowing users to more easily swipe between different cards and view card rewards, balances, and other information. Furthermore, Apple has partnered with American Express, enabling users to pay directly using American Express points during the Apple Pay checkout process, with each point valued at $0.7 American cents. The new 'Tap to Share' feature will be integrated into Apple Pay, offering a more personalized and faster in-store shopping experience by allowing users to securely share information such as email addresses, physical addresses, and membership points. In the future, users will also be able to manage debit card balances and recharge them directly within the Apple Pay interface. Additionally, Walmart and Sam’s Club have announced plans to gradually expand Apple Pay support, with an expected rollout across all US stores by the end of the year.",
    tags_en: ["Apple Pay", "iOS 27", "American Express", "Apple Wallet", "Tap to Share", "Apple"],
    sources: [
      { name: "9to5Mac", url: "https://9to5mac.com/2026/08/27/apple-pay-is-getting-even-better-with-four-new-features", lang: "EN" }
    ]
