    summary: "Apple 宣布在 Apple Arcade 上推出一場夏季最「偷偷摸摸」的跨界合作，將遊戲《Sneaky Sasquatch》與《Subway Surfers+》結合，並同步為 iMessage 應用程式提供貼圖。本次合作從當天開始，直到 10 月 7 日，玩家可以在《Subway Surfers+》中體驗到受《Sneaky Sasquatch》影響的風格，包括解鎖角色皮膚和獨特的滑板，並在以 Sasquatch Valley 為靈感的重塑關卡中奔跑。此外，遊戲還將在 9 月 17 日進行重大更新，屆時將加入觀鳥功能，玩家可以拍攝超過 30 種鳥類並提交給觀鳥員記錄，以賺取獎勵。文章指出，Apple Arcade 的資深總監 Alex Rofman 表示，這系列更新旨在讓玩家持續享受《Sneaky Sasquatch》的樂趣。",
    tags: ["Apple Arcade", "Sneaky Sasquatch", "Subway Surfers+", "iMessage", "Apple"],
    title_en: "Apple Arcade Announces Crossover Collaboration Between \"Sneaky Sasquatch\" and \"Subway Surfers+\", Adding iMessage Stickers",
    summary_en: "Apple announced a summer's most \"sneaky\" crossover collaboration on Apple Arcade, combining the games \"Sneaky Sasquatch\" and \"Subway Surfers+\", and simultaneously providing stickers for the iMessage application. This collaboration runs from the announcement date until October 7th. Players can experience a style influenced by \"Sneaky Sasquatch\" within \"Subway Surfers+\", including unlocking character skins and unique skateboards, and running through redesigned levels inspired by Sasquatch Valley. Furthermore, the game will receive a major update on September 17th, adding a bird-watching feature. Players can photograph over 30 species of birds and submit them to a birdwatcher to earn rewards. The article notes that Alex Rofman, Senior Director of Apple Arcade, stated that this series of updates aims to allow players to continuously enjoy the fun of \"Sneaky Sasquatch\".",
