    title: "Apple 宣布 11 款新產品，涵蓋 iPhone 17e、M4 iPad Air、MacBook 系列及 AirTag 2 等硬體更新",
    summary: "本文彙整了 Apple 在 2026 年上半年發布的硬體產品資訊，總計有 11 款新品。產品線涵蓋了從個人配件到專業工作站的各個層面。\n\n主要亮點包括：\n1. **iPhone 17e**：具備 A19 晶片、C1X modem，並將基礎儲存容量提高至 256GB。\n2. **iPad Air**：推出了搭載 M4 晶片的 11 吋和 13 吋版本，並配備 C1X 蜂巢式網路晶片。\n3. **MacBook 系列**：發布了 M5 MacBook Air、M5 Pro 和 M5 Max MacBook Pro，以及更經濟實惠的 MacBook Neo（搭載 A18 Pro 晶片）。\n4. **Mac mini 與 Mac Studio**：更新後的 Mac mini 可選擇 M6 或 M5 Pro 晶片，支援 Wi-Fi 7、藍牙 6 和 2.5Gb Ethernet；Mac Studio 則搭載 M5 Max 或 M5 Ultra，最高支援 512GB 統一記憶體。\n5. **配件更新**：AirTag 2 升級了超寬頻晶片，提升了定位範圍；AirPods Max 2 則具備 H2 晶片，增強了降噪和多種新功能。\n\n此外，Apple 還預告了 9 月 9 日的活動，預計將發表 iPhone 18 Pro、Apple Watch Series 12、Apple Watch Ultra 4 和 AirPods 5 等更多產品。",
    tags: ["Apple", "iPhone 17e", "M4 iPad Air", "MacBook", "AirTag 2", "M5 Max", "Apple Watch"],
    title_en: "Apple Unveils 11 New Products, Including iPhone 17e, M4 iPad Air, MacBook Line, and AirTag 2 Hardware Updates",
    summary_en: "This article compiles information on the hardware products Apple is set to release in the first half of 2026, totaling 11 new items. The product line spans from personal accessories to professional workstations.\n\nKey highlights include:\n1. **iPhone 17e**: Featuring the A19 chip and C1X modem, with base storage capacity increased to 256GB.\n2. **iPad Air**: Introducing 11-inch and 13-inch versions powered by the M4 chip, and equipped with the C1X cellular network chip.\n3. **MacBook Line**: Launching the M5 MacBook Air, M5 Pro, and M5 Max MacBook Pro, alongside the more budget-friendly MacBook Neo (powered by the A18 Pro chip).\n4. **Mac mini and Mac Studio**: The updated Mac mini can select between M6 or M5 Pro chips, supporting Wi-Fi 7, Bluetooth 6, and 2.5Gb Ethernet; the Mac Studio features M5 Max or M5 Ultra, supporting up to 512GB of unified memory.\n5. **Accessory Updates**: AirTag 2 upgrades to a UWB chip, enhancing tracking range; AirPods Max 2 features the H2 chip, improving noise cancellation and adding multiple new functions.\n\nAdditionally, Apple has previewed an event on September 9th, where it is expected to announce more products, including the iPhone 18 Pro, Apple Watch Series 12, Apple Watch Ultra 4, and AirPods 5.",
