    title: "三星 Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra 首次在彎曲測試中失效，顯示螢幕內層結構存在結構性弱點",
    summary: "這篇報導討論了三星最新的可折疊手機 Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra 在極端彎曲測試中的表現。儘管三星的折疊機型設計越來越纖薄，但 Z Fold 8 Ultra 卻成為首款在彎曲測試中發生故障的主流產品。在 YouTube 頻道 JerryRigEverything 的測試中，Z Fold 8 Ultra 的外層顯示器和<0xE9><0x89><0xB8>鏈結構雖然保持完整，但其內層顯示器卻發生了結構性破裂。值得注意的是，與 Z Fold 8 Ultra 相比，同系列的 Z Fold 8 卻能通過相同的彎曲測試。這指出在極致纖薄化設計下，折疊螢幕的內層結構可能存在需要改進的弱點，影響了產品的耐用性。",
    tags: ["Samsung", "Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra", "可折疊手機", "耐用性測試", "螢幕結構"],
    title_en: "Samsung Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra Fails in Bend Test, Revealing Structural Weakness in Inner Display Layer",
    summary_en: "This report discusses the performance of Samsung's latest foldable phone, the Galaxy Z Fold 8 Ultra, during extreme bending tests. Although Samsung's foldable devices are becoming increasingly thin, the Z Fold 8 Ultra became the first mainstream product to fail during a bend test. In a test conducted by the YouTube channel JerryRigEverything, while the outer display and hinge structure of the Z Fold 8 Ultra remained intact, its inner display suffered structural cracking. Notably, compared to the Z Fold 8 Ultra, the Z Fold 8 in the same series passed the same bending test. This suggests that under extreme thinness design, the inner structure of the foldable screen may have inherent weaknesses that require improvement, impacting the product's durability.",
