    summary: "Google 地圖目前在韓國市場主要僅提供地點、評論和公共交通路線指引等基礎服務，缺乏全球用戶習慣的轉彎導航（turn-by-turn navigation）功能。由於此功能缺失，導致其用戶數遠不及本地競爭對手 Naver Map 和 Kakao Map。為此，Google 已積極招募「策略合作夥伴發展經理」，並宣布計畫全面為韓國市場導入完整的 Google 地圖功能，包括轉彎導航。此舉是在韓國政府今年早些時候批准 Google 使用高精度地圖數據於海外伺服器後，條件為軍事及敏感設施需進行模糊處理，且將禁用緯度與經度座標。這預計將大幅提升 Google 地圖在韓國的在地化服務水平。",
    tags: ["Google Maps", "韓國", "轉彎導航", "Naver Map", "Kakao Map", "地圖服務"],
    title_en: "Google Maps Plans Full Rollout of Turn-by-Turn Navigation in South Korea to Enhance Local Service Capabilities",
    summary_en: "Currently, Google Maps in the South Korean market primarily offers basic services such as location listings, reviews, and public transit routing, lacking the turn-by-turn navigation feature standard for global users. This deficiency has resulted in its user base lagging significantly behind local competitors like Naver Map and Kakao Map. To address this, Google has actively recruited 'Strategic Partner Development Managers' and announced plans to fully introduce comprehensive Google Maps functionality, including turn-by-turn navigation, to the South Korean market. This move follows the South Korean government's earlier approval for Google to use high-precision map data on overseas servers, provided that military and sensitive facilities are blurred and that latitude and longitude coordinates are disabled. This is expected to significantly elevate Google Maps' localized service level in South Korea.",
