    title: "LM Studio 將 Z.ai 的 GLM-5.3-Flash 模型整合至 Bionic，支援多模態輸入與 100 萬 Token 上下文",
    summary: "LM Studio 宣布將 Z.ai 最新推出的 GLM-5.3-Flash 模型整合到其 AI 代理平台 Bionic 中。Bionic 是一個適用於 Mac 和 Windows 平台的工具，用於執行編碼、研究、文件處理等代理任務。GLM-5.3-Flash 是一款 3200 億參數的 Mixture-of-Experts 模型，具備 180 億個活躍參數，支援圖片和文字等多模態輸入，並擁有驚人的 100 萬 Token 上下文窗口。LM Studio 表示，相較於前代 GLM-5.2，新模型在運行成本上可降低高達 10 倍。此外，Bionic 平台除了支援雲端模型外，也提供本地運行模型，並承諾使用雲端服務時遵循嚴格的零資料保留政策。此更新擴展了 Bionic 的能力，使其能與業界領先的 Anthropic、OpenAI、Google 等模型競爭。",
    tags: ["LM Studio", "Bionic", "GLM-5.3-Flash", "Z.ai", "多模態", "大型語言模型"],
    title_en: "LM Studio Integrates Z.ai's GLM-5.3-Flash Model into Bionic, Supporting Multimodal Input and 1 Million Token Context",
    summary_en: "LM Studio announced the integration of Z.ai's latest GLM-5.3-Flash model into its AI agent platform, Bionic. Bionic is a tool for Mac and Windows that handles agent tasks such as coding, research, and document processing. GLM-5.3-Flash is a 320 billion parameter Mixture-of-Experts model with 18 billion active parameters, supporting multimodal inputs including images and text, and boasting an impressive 1 million token context window. LM Studio stated that compared to the previous generation GLM-5.2, the new model can reduce operational costs by up to 10 times. Furthermore, the Bionic platform supports both cloud and local model execution, and commits to adhering to a strict zero data retention policy when using cloud services. This update expands Bionic's capabilities, allowing it to compete with industry leaders such as Anthropic, OpenAI, and Google.",
