    title: "Nvidia 傳將斥資 129 億美元收購 Hugging Face，強化 AI 產業生態系整合",
    summary: "根據《The Information》的報導，Nvidia 據傳正推進以 129 億美元收購 AI 模型金庫 Hugging Face 的計畫。此次收購對於硬體巨頭 Nvidia 而言，能大幅擴展其在廣泛 AI 產業中的深度整合能力。Hugging Face 本身是一個雲端模型儲存庫，功能類似於 GitHub 在傳統軟體領域的角色，是開發者和研究人員尋找、下載、執行和微調 AI 模型的主要平台。雖然這筆交易尚未最終確定，但雙方均顯示出積極的推進意願。值得注意的是，除了 Nvidia 之外，Salesforce、Google 和 Microsoft 等公司也曾對 Hugging Face 進行過投資。這項收購行動凸顯了業界對開源權重模型（open-weight models）的重視，作為對抗 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 等公司專有閉源模型的替代方案。Nvidia 本人也已發布了名為 Nemotron 的開源模型系列。",
    tags: ["Nvidia", "Hugging Face", "AI 模型", "開源模型", "AI 產業", "收購案"],
    title_en: "Nvidia reportedly plans to acquire Hugging Face for $12.9 billion to strengthen AI industry ecosystem integration",
    summary_en: "According to a report by The Information, Nvidia is reportedly advancing a plan to acquire Hugging Face, the repository for AI models, for $12.9 billion. For the hardware giant Nvidia, this acquisition would significantly expand its deep integration capabilities across the broad AI industry. Hugging Face itself is a cloud model repository, functioning similarly to GitHub in the traditional software domain. It serves as the primary platform for developers and researchers to find, download, run, and fine-tune AI models. Although this deal has not been finalized, both parties have shown active momentum. Notably, companies other than Nvidia, such as Salesforce, Google, and Microsoft, have previously invested in Hugging Face. This acquisition move highlights the industry's focus on open-weight models as an alternative to proprietary, closed-source models from companies like OpenAI and Anthropic. Nvidia itself has also released an open-source model series called Nemotron.",
    tags_en: ["Nvidia", "Hugging Face", "AI Models", "Open-Source Models", "AI Industry", "Acquisition"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Ars Technica", url: "https://arstechnica.com/ai/2026/08/report-nvidia-to-acquire-ai-model-repository-hugging-face-for-13-billion", lang: "EN" }
    ]
