    category: "重點關注",
    title: "AMD Lemonade 11.8 支援 DeepSeek V4 Flash，簡化在 Strix Halo 系統上運行大型語言模型",
    summary: "AMD 發布了 Lemonade 11.8 軟體更新，顯著簡化了在搭載 AMD Ryzen AI+ Max Strix Halo 系統上的大型語言模型（LLM）部署流程。該更新特別整合了實驗性的 DwarfStar \"ds4\" 後端，讓使用者能更輕鬆地運行 DeepSeek V4 Flash 模型。對於擁有 Framework Desktop 或 Ryzen AI Halo 等 Strix Halo 系統的用戶而言，Lemonade 11.8 提供了一個順暢的部署體驗。此外，Lemonade 11.8 的模型目錄也增加了 RPG-HaloTales-V2 聊天模型、Flux-2-Klein-4B/9B 圖像模型，以及新的 OpenMOSS 語音設計和音效語音模型，並新增了 `lemonade update-models` 指令，方便用戶更新模型。這項更新主要針對 AI 應用開發者和硬體使用者，提升了在 AMD 平台上的 AI 內容生成能力。",
    tags: ["AMD", "Lemonade 11.8", "DeepSeek V4 Flash", "Strix Halo", "LLM", "DwarfStar"],
    title_en: "AMD Lemonade 11.8 Supports DeepSeek V4 Flash, Simplifying Large Language Model Deployment on Strix Halo Systems",
    summary_en: "AMD has released the Lemonade 11.8 software update, significantly simplifying the deployment process for large language models (LLMs) on systems equipped with AMD Ryzen AI+ Max Strix Halo. This update specifically integrates the experimental DwarfStar \"ds4\" backend, allowing users to run the DeepSeek V4 Flash model with greater ease. For users with Strix Halo systems, such as the Framework Desktop or Ryzen AI Halo, Lemonade 11.8 provides a seamless deployment experience. Furthermore, the Lemonade 11.8 model directory has been expanded to include the RPG-HaloTales-V2 chat model, the Flux-2-Klein-4B/9B image models, and new OpenMOSS voice design and sound effect voice models. It also introduces the `lemonade update-models` command, making it easier for users to update models. This update is primarily aimed at AI application developers and hardware users, enhancing AI content generation capabilities on the AMD platform.",
    tags_en: ["AMD", "Lemonade 11.8", "DeepSeek V4 Flash", "Strix Halo", "LLM", "DwarfStar"],
    sources: [
      { name: "Phoronix", url: "https://phoronix.com/news/AMD-Lemonade-11.8", lang: "EN" }
    ]
