    title: "數據毒（Datadog）在「數據毒 Secure 2026」上強調AI時代的雲端安全與可觀測性整合策略",
    summary: "數據毒（Datadog）在「數據毒 Secure 2026」活動中，針對快速變化的網路威脅環境，特別聚焦於AI Agent和大型語言模型（LLM）帶來的企業安全挑戰。數據毒指出，企業必須在基礎設施、數據、模型和AI Agent等四個層面內建安全機制。為此，公司需要建立一套能夠實時觀察和控制AI Agent行為的系統。數據毒提出將其核心優勢——整合式可觀測性（Observability）與安全功能——融合於單一平台，透過分析開發與營運環境的龐大數據，並獲取運行時上下文（Runtime Context），從而快速、準確地決定威脅應對的優先級，強化AI系統的安全性。活動中，多位專家分享了從提示詞（Prompt）漏洞防禦、程式碼供應鏈到運行時的威脅追蹤技術，以及MSSP和SIEM/CSPM的整合應用，強調了整合式可觀測性在實戰中的重要性。",
    tags: ["Datadog", "AI Agent", "LLM", "可觀測性", "雲端安全", "SIEM", "CSPM"],
    title_en: "Datadog Highlights Integrated Cloud Security and Observability Strategies for the AI Era at 'Datadog Secure 2026'",
    summary_en: "At 'Datadog Secure 2026,' Datadog focused on the enterprise security challenges posed by AI Agents and Large Language Models (LLMs) within a rapidly changing threat landscape. Datadog emphasized that enterprises must embed security mechanisms across four layers: infrastructure, data, models, and AI Agents. To achieve this, companies need to establish systems capable of real-time monitoring and controlling AI Agent behavior. Datadog proposed integrating its core strengths—Observability and security functions—into a single platform. By analyzing massive amounts of data from development and operational environments and acquiring Runtime Context, organizations can quickly and accurately prioritize threat response, thereby enhancing the security of AI systems. During the event, multiple experts shared techniques ranging from prompt vulnerability defense and code supply chain security to runtime threat tracking, highlighting the importance of integrated observability in real-world scenarios, including the integration of MSSP and SIEM/CSPM.",
